  biomeName: Dune-Drains
  minDepthMeters: 2500
  maxDepthMeters: 3000
  shortDescription: Funnel sinkholes centered in every silt wave.
  isPlaceholder: 0
  visitPurpose: Transition biome. Come here to push deeper, find better materials,
    and keep orientation in soft terrain and hunt hidden value.
  commonRewardHook: Reliable value comes from Silica Shards and Copper Ore.
  rareRewardHook: 'The rare pull is real: Electrolyte Salts and Sealant Pack.'
  landmarkIdentity: Dune-Drains reads through dunes, plains, void cuts, and shape
    changes in the floor. Landmarks should feel large and route-defining.
  safePocketIdentity: Safe pockets exist, but they must be earned by reading the
    terrain.
  riskSummary: 'Main failure mode: orientation loss and long empty recovery swims,
    then overstaying for loot. Creature pressure stays low_to_medium.'
  extractionFocus: 'Broad sweep collection, light salvage, and scattered node stops.
    Mid-depth: accept longer sweeps and weaker orientation during gathering, then
    return before greed stretches the route.'
  landmarkGuidance: Dominant landmark is basin lip or dune crest line. This slot
    should read through fan-shaped sediment flows; use silhouette changes to avoid
    getting lost in soft terrain.
